message: "If you use this software in research, product, or standards work, please cite both the software entry below and the IETF Internet-Draft listed under references."
title: "SAIHM — Sovereign AI Horizontal Memory"
abstract: "Sovereign, encrypted, persistent memory protocol for AI agents. Eight Model Context Protocol tools (remember, recall, forget, share, governance) provide ML-DSA-signed AES-256-GCM cells with GDPR Article 17 cryptographic erasure. Anchored on COTI V2 mainnet."
